No model-specific device rules
------------------------------
This package intentionally does not install udev rules for individual camera
models. Video capture uses the standard uvcvideo device permissions.

Some cameras expose vendor-specific controls over raw USB. Those controls are
optional, and granting access to a raw USB device is an administrative policy
decision. This package does not change device permissions or install rules for
particular hardware.

Configuration
-------------
Shutter settings are stored per user in:

  $XDG_CONFIG_HOME/ircam-viewer.conf

or, when XDG_CONFIG_HOME is unset:

  $HOME/.config/ircam-viewer.conf

The configuration file is not shipped by the package; it is created when the
user asks ircam to save settings.
